WEBVTT

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:45.960
Yuzuyu-chan,

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:48.790
your pick up is awfully late.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:50.160
That's very strange.

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:53.060
I'll try calling your home right now.

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:56.950
Yuzuyu-chan, while we wait, let's fold origami!

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:58.060
Okay.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.670
Let's fold cranes together, everybody!

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:02.530
Yeah, let's fold cranes.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:03.820
Cranes?

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:08.770
Here.  You too, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.310
I can't fold a crane.

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:37.770
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.300
Your pick up has arrived.

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:46.480
Kippei-onii-chan...

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.580
Oh shoot!

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.290
Katakura-san...

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.370
I'm late.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.500
Yuzuyu-chan was picked up earlier and went home.

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:41.040
You...

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:42.540
Yes...

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:47.620
How could you neglect to pick up Yuzuyu-chan?!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.780
I'll skin you!

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:56.410
I'm sorry!

00:03:56.910 --> 00:04:00.070
Call if you can't pick her up!

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:01.180
Yes!

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.210
I want to punch you!

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:08.300
It's a good thing I was able to pick her up today.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:11.730
If it's too much for you to take care of her on your own...

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.070
I can take care of her.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.270
No, it's fine.

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:19.590
I'll do it... properly.

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.640
It's okay for now.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.000
Hurry up and go apologize to Yuzuyu-chan.

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:36.190
Kippei Yuzuyu's Room

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:50.310
Yuzuyu.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.160
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.450
You're home?

00:04:59.080 --> 00:04:59.430
Yeah.

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:02.020
I'm home.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.900
Let's do origami!

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:06.600
Origami!

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:07.700
Yeah.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:17.710
I borrowed a book on origami from preschool.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.160
But, it's hard.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.020
I'm sorry about today.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.460
I'll make you a greally good one!

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.400
Yay!

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.290
Tada!

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:56.240
Look!  Airplane!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.990
Hey!  I wanted to fold a crane!

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:20.610
I'm no good.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:26.690
My mom had already picked her up by the time I got there.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.840
Yuzuyu-chan?

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:29.920
Yeah.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.920
I got in trouble.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:34.910
You?

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.550
Straighten up!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:41.250
Yes!

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:45.800
Although it's half your fault because I was with you.

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:51.760
Yuzuyu-chan wants you to pick her up.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.310
That's right, so I have to do my best.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.200
What's with you two?  Are you in love or something?

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:10.040
Kokoro-chan, why do you like me?

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:17.120
She seems really annoyed.

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.500
You don't have any worries.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:25.590
Huh?  Wasn't I just worried?

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.050
You seem stupid.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.500
I'm not the smartest, but you don't need to be so blunt.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:40.370
I thought that if I was with you, then all my worries would seem silly...

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.790
And that I could smile more.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.090
Aren't you lonely at night?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:07.990
I'm fine.

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.140
Things like this seem stupid.

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:00.550
It seems so stupid that it puts me at ease.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.870
Hey Kippei!  Why you...

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:19.480
Geez... Since when?

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:24.160
You idiiot!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.380
Die!

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:33.990
Let's go, Kokoro!  What are you getting carried away for?!

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.700
Kokoro!

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.830
We have to change classrooms next period.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.680
Come on, Kokoro.  Get up!

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:42.840
Let's go!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.960
Hurry up or I'll leave you.

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:00.110
Okay.

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:03.010
Kokoro!  Hurry up!

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:17.840
I wonder if I can see Kippei-san today?

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:22.040
Kippei-onii-chan is coming to get me.

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.640
I know that!

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.260
That's why I'm sad!

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:29.110
Don't be so snobby!

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:35.340
Yuzuyu-chan, Onii-chan has come to get you.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:37.930
Yay!

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:40.600
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.140
Yay!

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:46.310
You're early today!

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.770
Yuzuyu!  Why you...

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:52.760
Want to go to the park on the way home?

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:53.750
Yeah!

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:10.160
Who's that girl?

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:47.600
It's hot!

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:51.150
I'm going to go play in the sandbox.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.730
I'm going to go buy some drinks.

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:03.240
Kokoro-chan, you play in the sandbox too!

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:08.420
Don't suddenly go home.  Got it?

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:05.990
Wait.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:08.480
Wait. Wait.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:25.270
When I was little, I used to play just like this.

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:31.920
Kippei-onii-chan is very good at playing in the sandbox.

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:50.800
I didn't have a mother either, but...

00:13:57.180 --> 00:14:01.210
You have Kippei, so you'll be fine.

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:15.870
This is cold!

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.500
My hands are dying!

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:22.310
Kokoro-onee-chan...

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:29.070
do you like Kippei-onii-chan?

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:44.220
Not at all.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:51.630
It's alright.

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:57.260
I won't take Kippei away from you.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:17.460
Bye, Kokoro-chan.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:27.940
Kippei-onii-chan, you know the crane I made yesterday?

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:10.490
Ouch!

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:17.930
What time is it right now?

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:23.960
I overslept!

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:26.630
Thank you for the meal.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.570
No matter how many times I tried to wake you...

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:35.690
you wouldn't wake up, so I already made Yuzuyu-chan's lunch.

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:39.320
It's right there, okay?

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.160
Take that, hurry up and go!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.500
Ah... I see.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.020
Sorry, Yuzuyu!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:51.560
I'm really sorry!

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.240
Starting tomorrow, I'll get up on time!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.250
I promise!

00:16:56.610 --> 00:17:01.540
Mom made that lunch, so it should be much better than the ones I make.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:07.680
Kippei-onii-chan...

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.300
Never mind.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:32.780
Bye!  I'm going!

00:17:55.980 --> 00:18:03.060
What's wrong with me?!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:17.810
Hey, Yuzuyu!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:23.910
Who was that girl with the dark aura with Kippei-san?

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:29.360
Hey, who is it?!  Who is it?!  Who is it?!

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:30.720
I don't know.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:36.510
I didn't like that feeling!

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:41.750
I can't accept it!

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:55.330
Okay everyone, let's put away all the toys and get ready to go home!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:57.860
Okay!

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:08.690
Sensei?

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:09.740
Yes?

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.370
What's wrong, Yuzuyu-chan?

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.640
I'm going to go home by myself starting today.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:20.480
What about the people from your home?

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:23.310
Can you make it home on your own, Yuzuyu-chan?

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:25.720
Goodbye.

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:31.080
W-wait just a minute!  I'm going to call your house.

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:39.800
Hey, even Sensei told you to wait.

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.790
I think you should wait.

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:45.350
You can go home by yourself?

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:50.430
I can get home by myself!

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:52.930
Wait a minute!

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:58.920
This world isn't safe enough for you to go out there by yourself.

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:08.460
Kippei-onii-chan wants to be with Kokoro-onee-chan!

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:18.600
It's tiring for Kippei-onii-chan to pick me up and make me lunch!

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:23.480
If I can't do it by myself...

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:27.070
I'm just going to be in the way!

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:33.300
There she goes...

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:37.300
What's with her?  I don't understand.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:41.300
Huh?  Where's Yuzuyu-chan?

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.240
She went home!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.150
I'm going to get there early today!

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:57.610
Katakura-san!

00:20:59.220 --> 00:20:59.660
What?

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.990
I have a bad feeling...

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:06.010
Yuzuyu-chan disappeared!

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.410
What?!  Again?!

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:13.310
She said she was going to go home alone and when I took my eyes off of her for just a second...

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:16.390
Why?

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:22.520
Kippei-onii-chan.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.420
Never mind.

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:20.840
Yuzuyu!  Where did you go?

00:24:21.360 --> 00:24:23.300
I can get home by myself!

00:24:23.570 --> 00:24:26.900
Kippei-onii-chan has Kokoro-onee-chan.

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:28.270
Yuzuyu!

00:24:28.650 --> 00:24:31.180
Let's go home together, Doggy.

00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:33.290
Where am I?

00:24:33.640 --> 00:24:34.950
Yuzuyu!

00:24:35.310 --> 00:24:37.750
I-It's dark and scary!

00:24:38.010 --> 00:24:39.720
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:24:40.400 --> 00:24:42.130
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:42.300 --> 00:24:45.000
Dumpling, Yuzuyu, and Kokoro

00:24:45.350 --> 00:24:47.420
What are you doing there?
